# DRC-SP-CORN-1: spacing poly ndiff 2 corner_ok nfet; poly meeting ndiff at an nfet corner; a 1-unit poly-ndiff gap.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/drctest -noprompt
snap internal
drc off
load top
box 0 0 10 10
paint ndiff
box 4 -3 6 13
paint poly
box 6 10 12 13
paint poly
box 30 0 40 10
paint ndiff
box 41 0 45 10
paint poly
select top cell
box grow center 100
drc check
drc catchup
drc listall why
drc list count total
save top
